2026-10-31T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2423) 'the setting is a port of the Sakuragaoka station plaza
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2423  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2423) 'The two players stand in a train-station plaza, a port of the MIT-licensed procedural three.js scene `sakuragaoka-station`, placed at &{repo("sakuragaoka-station")} (&{pin("sakuragaoka-station")}). The port lives in &{repo("entities-sakuragaoka-station")}, and the pen vendors it with `tools/vendor_station.sh <commit>`, which takes only a commit some remote branch contains.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2423  1 LINE
 Text:Written

