 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2423) 'The station port is abandoned
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2423  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2423) 'RFD66606-2384, the module-by-module port, is abandoned (operator, 2026-11-11). The plaza's assets and tech stay in use, and baking goes through slughorn.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2423  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2423) 'Why the port rebuilds the scene
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2423  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2423) 'Its 43,727 lines of JavaScript under `src/` generate every texture in code and keep no mesh on disk, so the port rebuilds the scene in the engine with MToon materials rather than importing it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2423  1 LINE
 Text:Written

